        <li><a href="../docs/unit-04/while-loops.html">while Loops</a> — indeterminate iteration</li>
        <li><a href="../docs/unit-04/for-loops.html">for Loops</a> — comparison with while</li>
        <li><a href="../docs/unit-03/combat-system.html">Combat Engine (Unit 3)</a> — attack logic you're reusing</li>
    </ul>
</div>`;
